WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:10.540
Ladies and gentlemen of NASA, this is Charles Xavier.

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:11.840
Help is on the way.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:14.500
We're doing space missions now.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:15.240
Cool.

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:19.640
We get the astronauts we bring them home.

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:20.720
Go.

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:23.740
Heat signatures rising fast.

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:25.500
We got to get out of here.

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:27.400
Where's Jean?

00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:28.420
Where is she?!?

00:00:29.480 --> 00:00:30.060
Jean!

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:39.820
She should be dead.

00:00:39.820 --> 00:00:42.220
Did you hear what the kids are calling you?

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:45.520
Phoenix.

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:47.020
Hello Jean.

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:48.920
Who are you?

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:51.520
The better question is, who are you?

00:00:52.760 --> 00:00:54.840
Something's happening to me.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:57.820
When I lose control, bad things happen.

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:03.420
Well, it feels good.

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:09.500
That power destroyed everything it ever came into contact with....

00:01:10.360 --> 00:01:12.140
...until you.

00:01:12.380 --> 00:01:14.360
The X-Men fear you.

00:01:15.120 --> 00:01:16.220
...and what they fear...

00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:17.940
...they seek to destroy.

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:22.200
She'll kill us all.

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:29.860
A girl dies.

00:01:32.480 --> 00:01:34.080
She's still our friend.

00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:36.440
She's not Jean anymore.

00:01:42.360 --> 00:01:43.900
That's right.

00:01:44.360 --> 00:01:46.360
That would be a bad idea.

00:01:48.220 --> 00:01:48.720
Jean!

